WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:22.768
Tom walked around his lab.

2
00:00:22.769 --> 00:00:25.891
"I must help Tink," he said.

3
00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:28.767
Just then Ann rushed in.

4
00:00:28.768 --> 00:00:33.856
"The king said to come quickly!" Ann said.

5
00:00:33.857 --> 00:00:40.078
Tom and Cat ran outside.

6
00:00:40.079 --> 00:00:49.582
A crowd was gathered at the wall.

7
00:00:49.583 --> 00:00:53.112
Water poured from a crack.

8
00:00:53.113 --> 00:00:57.222
"Tink was looking at that crack!" Tom thought.

9
00:00:57.223 --> 00:01:00.830
"Do something, Tom!" Dirk cried.

10
00:01:00.831 --> 00:01:07.886
"I have an idea," Ann said.

11
00:01:07.887 --> 00:01:13.104
She handed gum to each person. "Chew!"

12
00:01:13.105 --> 00:01:23.374
Everyone chewed.

13
00:01:23.375 --> 00:01:31.520
Cat ran to the Grim Dungeon.

14
00:01:31.521 --> 00:01:35.376
"Now throw your gum at the crack!" Ann said.

15
00:01:35.377 --> 00:01:41.393
Everybody threw.

16
00:01:41.394 --> 00:01:49.016
The gum plugged the crack.

17
00:01:49.017 --> 00:01:51.653
"It's working!" Tom said.

18
00:01:51.654 --> 00:01:54.364
Then all the gum fell off.

19
00:01:54.365 --> 00:02:01.048
The leak got bigger!

20
00:02:01.049 --> 00:02:03.492
"Wizard!" said the king.

21
00:02:03.493 --> 00:02:06.862
"Fix it now!"

22
00:02:06.863 --> 00:02:10.008
Tom pointed his wand at the crack.

23
00:02:10.009 --> 00:02:12.595
"I wish—" Poof!

24
00:02:12.596 --> 00:02:14.329
Fish appeared.

25
00:02:14.330 --> 00:02:18.025
"Oops," Tom said.

26
00:02:18.026 --> 00:02:21.642
"Do something, Wizard," Dirk yelled.

27
00:02:21.643 --> 00:02:28.073
"Or join your friend in the Grim Dungeon!"

28
00:02:28.074 --> 00:02:30.817
Tom closed his eyes.

29
00:02:30.818 --> 00:02:35.419
He waved his wand, and . . .

30
00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:41.202
Tink and Cat appeared!

31
00:02:41.203 --> 00:02:50.165
"I can fix that leak!" Tink said.

32
00:02:50.166 --> 00:03:00.593
Soon water stopped pouring from the crack.

33
00:03:00.594 --> 00:03:04.075
"Tink is a bad jester," said the king.

34
00:03:04.076 --> 00:03:06.595
"But he's a great tinker!"

35
00:03:06.596 --> 00:03:09.545
"Good work, Tom," said Ann.

36
00:03:09.546 --> 00:03:14.941
"You saved the day!"

37
00:03:14.942 --> 00:03:18.726
Tom felt proud.

38
00:03:18.727 --> 00:03:26.862
And so did Cat.
